And that nuance is key.

639
00:27:25,170 --> 00:27:26,090
It's everything.

640
00:27:26,430 --> 00:27:30,980
That's what takes your communication from just, okay, just functional to being really effective.

641
00:27:31,300 --> 00:27:35,620
It helps you build stronger relationships, collaborate better, and just make a bigger impact.

642
00:27:35,980 --> 00:27:38,190
Choosing the right words at the right time.

